CHAPTER.VERS:
And no wonder!  For even Hasatan transforms himself into a malach of ohr 

          light
        ;

in journeys often,  Pikuach nefesh 

          imminent danger
         from rivers, pikuach nefesh from robbers, pikuach nefesh from my own people [Act 9:23], pikuach nefesh from Goyim [Act 14:5], pikuach nefesh in the city, pikuach nefesh in the country, pikuach nefesh in the sea, pikuach nefesh among achei sheker;
